{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39755","headline":"奉和翁文尧员外文秀光贤昼锦之什 三 · 黄滔","name":"奉和翁文尧员外文秀光贤昼锦之什 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君王面赐紫还乡，金紫中推是甲裳。\n华构便将垂美号，故山重更发清光。\n水澄此日兰宫镜，树忆当年栢署霜。\n珍重朱栏兼翠拱，来来皆自读书堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39755.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39755","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}